#: ../../li3po4/beta-gamma-comparison.rst:4
msgid "β相・γ相の結晶構造"
msgstr "Crystal Structures of the β and γ Phases"

#: ../../li3po4/beta-gamma-comparison.rst:6
msgid ""
"CHGNetで最適化したLi₃PO₄の結晶構造は、文献DFT-PBEの結果にどの程度近いでしょうか。\\ 式量当たりの体積は、β相"
"・γ相とも文献DFT-PBEの値と0.1%以内で一致しました。\\ "
"実験値を基準とした格子定数の平均相対誤差も、CHGNetの1.19%・1.23%に対し、文献DFT-"
"PBEでは1.17%・1.21%と同程度でした。"
msgstr ""
"How closely do the Li₃PO₄ crystal structures optimized with CHGNet agree "
"with the results of DFT-PBE (Li et al.)? \\ In both the β and γ phases, "
"the volumes per formula unit agreed with DFT-PBE (Li et al.) to within "
"0.1%. \\ The mean relative errors in the lattice constants compared with "
"the experimental values were also similar: 1.19% and 1.23% for CHGNet, "
"compared with 1.17% and 1.21% for DFT-PBE (Li et al.)."

#: ../../li3po4/beta-gamma-comparison.rst:11
#: ../../li3po4/beta-gamma-comparison.rst:19
msgid "格子定数と体積"
msgstr "Lattice Constants and Volume"

#: ../../li3po4/beta-gamma-comparison.rst:13
msgid ""
":numref:`li3po4-lattice-constants` "
"では、CHGNetとOpenMX/PBEの結果を、文献の計算値と実験値に並べます。\\ "
"β相の単位胞は16原子（Li₃PO₄の2式量）、γ相は32原子（4式量）なので、体積は1式量当たりに換算しました。\\ "
"本計算で掲載する機械学習モデルの格子定数はCHGNetの値です。文献の格子定数は\\ `Liらの表II "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4997242>`__\\ によります。"
msgstr ""
":numref:`li3po4-lattice-constants` compares the CHGNet and OpenMX/PBE "
"results with published calculated and experimental values. \\ The β-phase"
" unit cell contains 16 atoms (2 formula units of Li₃PO₄) and the γ-phase "
"unit cell contains 32 atoms (4 formula units), so we converted the "
"volumes to values per formula unit. \\ The lattice constants we report "
"for a machine-learning model in this work are those obtained with CHGNet."
" The published lattice constants come from \\ `Li et al., Table II "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4997242>`__\\ ."

