#: ../../li3po4/beta-gamma-comparison.rst:50
msgid ""
":numref:`li3po4-lattice-errors` に、格子定数と体積の実験値からの相対差を百分率で示します。\\ 計算値を "
":math:`x_{\\mathrm{calc}}`、実験値を :math:`x_{\\mathrm{exp}}` とすると、相対差は "
":math:`100(x_{\\mathrm{calc}}/x_{\\mathrm{exp}}-1)` です。\\ "
"「平均」は三軸の格子定数の相対差の絶対値を平均した値です。"
msgstr ""
":numref:`li3po4-lattice-errors` shows the percentage differences in "
"lattice constants and volumes relative to experiment. \\ For a calculated"
" value :math:`x_{\\mathrm{calc}}` and an experimental value "
":math:`x_{\\mathrm{exp}}`, the relative difference is "
":math:`100(x_{\\mathrm{calc}}/x_{\\mathrm{exp}}-1)`. \\ “Mean” is the "
"average of the absolute relative differences in the lattice constants "
"along the three axes."

